      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The sales price quoted of $4100 was reduced by $500 when I mentioned to the salesperson that the company was recommended to me by a friend.  The salesperson asked who the person was who recommended Sync Energy and upon checking up the veracity of my statement reduced the quote by $500 if I would sign the contract today.  I did so.The installation date mentioned was 2-4 weeks, however, this was postponed twice due to really bad weather in Adelaide in November. (Understandable).The installation went unhindered and tidy up was very good.  The installer/s were contracted to the company and did not provide all information or explanation of how the system worked until asked. The installer helped with grid installation and communicated with my energy supplier who initiated the system within one day - excellent!Unfortunately, I have no photos to share as I am unable to get up onto the roof myself.",
