      "review_description": "The sales process was a little confusing as most of the Solar firms gave a quote online without viewing the property or being available for questions on site, walk you through the process.Sync Solar had a good rep ,who came to the property, went through the process start to Finnish, while not the cheapest quote their product seems to be of a high quality.Install was on time, very polite crew of 3 who did the job very efficiently, a few tiles were damaged during the install, which they stated may happen and  I had spares available, the were very neat and tidy and explained the inverter shut down and start up process and set up the app on my phone for me.Sync Solar have done all the organisation for the metre change and grid setup.",
