      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Got the recommendation of  Sync Energy from  a friend. Called them and they offered very good price, the sales person was knowledgeable. I originally got the quote for 6.6Kw System (5KV inverter) from different companies but Sync Energy offered good advice and I ended up installing bit bigger system of 7.9 Kw (6KV inverter with 5kw export limit) in a very good price.Installation process was very Smooth. Team arrived early morning on promised Time and completed the installation with in 5 hours.  No roof tile damage was done and installation was done very cleanly and professionally.They also done the process of application to retailer for Grid connection and meter upgrade.So far I am very satisfied with the installation and System is performing very good without any issues.",
